# post bf: promoted post and Video Tab item policy
# Normative specification: docs/policy/post md ABI: docs/BRAINFUCK_ARCHITECTURE md
# Serves OP_CLASSIFY_POST OP_VIDEO_BATCH and OP_VIDEO_DECIDE
# The entry identifier grammar runs character by character: a segment scanner
# classifies every hyphen separated segment and a small set of state bits
# follows the grammar over the segment tokens A substring machine watches for
# the word promoted anywhere in the text
# Idioms: equality test on a copy (f e t cells) run once if carry by unit
# Every cell except the header returns to zero before it is reused
#
# Tape layout
# %cell MAJ 0
# %cell OP 1
# %cell ID0 2
# %cell ID1 3
# %cell J 4
# %cell UNH 5
# %cell S 6
# %cell NS 7
# %cell CH 8
# %cell K 9
# %cell L0 10
# %cell L1 11
# %cell DEAD 12
# %cell MS 13
# %cell NMS 14
# %cell MENT 15
# %cell TOK 16
# %cell B0 17
# %cell BM 18
# %cell BP1 19
# %cell BP2 20
# %cell BPA 21
# %cell BO1 22
# %cell BOA 23
# %cell N0 24
# %cell NM 25
# %cell NP1 26
# %cell NP2 27
# %cell NPA 28
# %cell NO1 29
# %cell NOA 30
# %cell KIND 31
# %cell MFLAG 32
# %cell t0 33   scratch; zero whenever free
# %cell t1 34   scratch; zero whenever free
# %cell t2 35   scratch; zero whenever free
# %cell t3 36   scratch; zero whenever free
# %cell t4 37   scratch; zero whenever free
# %cell t5 38   scratch; zero whenever free
